examples.solution_text:
(a) The whole gap is $0.32-0.24=0.08$.
Half the gap is $0.04$.
$0.24+0.04=0.28$
(b) Each interval is $0.08\div4=0.02$.
$S=0.26$ and $T=0.30$.
$T$ is to the right of $S$, so $T$ is greater.
